<p style="font-size:22px;line-height:1.3;margin:0 0 16px;color:#ffffff;">Reset your password</p>
<p>Hi{{#if firstName}} {{firstName}}{{/if}}, we received a request to reset your AUTHENTIC password.</p>
<p style="margin:28px 0;">
  <a href="{{{resetUrl}}}" style="display:inline-block;background:#14b8a6;color:#06201c;text-decoration:none;font-weight:700;padding:12px 20px;border-radius:999px;">Choose a new password</a>
</p>
<p style="font-size:13px;color:#8ea0bb;">This link expires in 30 minutes. If you did not request it, you can ignore this email — your password stays the same.</p>
<p style="font-size:13px;color:#8ea0bb;">API clients can POST the token to <code>/api/v1/auth/reset-password</code>:<br />{{token}}</p>
